        },
        {
          "text": "Ngomnyaka wamatshumi amahlanu lambili wokubusa kukaAzariya inkosi yakoJuda uPeka indodana kaRemaliya waba yinkosi koIsrayeli eSamariya; wabusa iminyaka engamatshumi amabili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wenza okubi phambi kweNkosi, kazitshiyanga izono zikaJerobowamu indodana kaNebati ezenza uIsrayeli one. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ensukwini zikaPeka inkosi yakoIsrayeli uTigilathi‐Pileseri inkosi yaseAsiriya wafika wathumba iIjoni, leAbeli‐Beti‐Mahaka, leJanowa, leKedeshi, leHazori, leGileyadi, leGalili, lonke ilizwe lakoNafitali; wathumba abantu, wabesa eAsiriya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UHosheya indodana kaEla wamenzela icebo uPeka indodana kaRemaliya, wamtshaya wambulala, wabusa esikhundleni sakhe ngomnyaka wamatshumi amabili wokubusa kukaJothamu, indodana kaUziya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ezinye indaba zikaPeka lakho konke akwenzayo kulotshiwe ogwalweni lwezindaba zamakhosi akoIsrayeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
